ind":"update","title":"Demo Update (0.1.0.0), 18th October 2026","summary":"Tonight I've put together what will probably be the last update prior to NextFest (which is less than 20 hours away now, ahhhhhhhh....) This update adds some new display settings, improves the UI around Encyclopedia unlockables and adds sound effects to the Mining Tools.Improvement: More resolution options and fullscreen modeThe games settings now have a much fuller set of resolution options as well as the option to select Windowed or Fullscreen. Fullscreen will just use your monitors native res","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:42:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4622380-1845383656397481","game_id":"steam-4622380","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update (0.0.3.1), 5th October 2026","summary":"Yesterday I launched a small update to add a new feature to the encyclopedia and the asteroid chunks.Feature: Unlocked Encyclopedia entries will now grant a production/output bonus for the mining tool they relate toEncyclopedia entries will now indicate that they provide an X% bonus to production/output to a given mining tool once unlocked. Note that entries that have already been unlocked won't provide a bonus retroactively. I would have liked for them to but I didn't quite have the time these ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:59:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4622380-1844751498219523","game_id":"steam-4622380","kind":"update","title":"Demo update (0.0.2), 23rd September 2026","summary":"Tonight we've released a short patch to resolve a couple of issues.Bug: Unlocking Tier 4 causes the game to crash (many thanks to the player who reported this issue in the game forum!)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T20:34:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219523","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4622380-1844115010505064","game_id":"steam-4622380","kind":"announcement","title":"Idle Mining Manager Demo is now Live","summary":"The Demo is now Live!You can now try out the first few tiers of content in the Idle Mining Manager Demo, which includes access to all the main gameplay systems. I expect the demo will have at least 30 minutes of content leading up to the unlocking of Tier 3 (the current end point for the demo). Those who want to unlock all of the upgrades and Encyclopedia content will probably get a bit more time from it.In the next day or two I'll be patching the game with a few additional features and some qua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T17:52:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505064","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4622380-1844115010499369","game_id":"steam-4622380","kind":"announcement","title":"Idle Mining Manager Demo launching tomorrow!","summary":"Trainee Mining Manager's, your chance to demonstrate your clicking prowess is almost upon us! On the 21st September, at approximately 21:00 BST (GMT+1) the Idle Mining Manager Demo will be launching on Steam. The Demo button should appear on the main game page, but it also has a separate store page here: Idle Mining Manager Demo It will be a little rough around the edges - there are a few features I haven't quite gotten up to scratch as of this weekend. However, I'll be addressing these every ev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T16:42:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499369","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4622380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4622380":"2026-10-26T13:14:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4622380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:41Z"},"4792660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:42Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4622380","app_id":4622380,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:43Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b19263be94bccd9ee0193889fc642fcfb5225d7ebdb547fc3c853230f9f561d9","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"An idle asteroid mining management simulator.  Earn credits and advance through corporate tiers to expand your range of mining tools, policy upgrades and resource efficiency.  Unlock the history of interstellar mining since the NofVS and, with a little help, uncover the truth behind the propaganda.","publishers":[{"name":"RiverDen Software"}],"developers":[{"name":"RiverDen Software"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"